      "writtenOn": "2026-05-19T22:49:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You can reuse your existing `Get32Le` function inside `GetChecksum` to avoid manual bit-shifting.\n\n**Action:** Refactor `GetChecksum`:\n\n```c\nstd::optional\u003cuint32_t\u003e IapControl::GetChecksum(std::span\u003cconst uint8_t\u003e buff) {\n  if ((buff.size() % 4) !\u003d 0) return std::nullopt;\n\n  uint32_t checksum \u003d 0;\n  for (size_t i \u003d 0; i \u003c buff.size(); i +\u003d 4) {\n    if (auto val \u003d Get32Le(buff.subspan(i, 4))) {\n      checksum +\u003d *val;\n    }\n  }\n  return checksum;\n}\n\n```",
